/T (Deepak Enterprises traces its roots back to 1975, when it was established by Kanji Bhai Virji Bhai Kamdiya. Built on a strong foundation of dedication, integrity, and craftsmanship, the business grew under the leadership of his son, Maheshbhai Kamdiya, who expanded the company's operations and strengthened its market presence. Today, the third generation, Raj Kamdiya, carries this proud legacy forward, leading the business with a modern vision while preserving the values on which it was founded. With a commitment to quality, precision, and customer satisfaction, Deepak Enterprises continues to build lasting partnerships and deliver reliable brass components for diverse industrial and electrical applications.)
